  "title": "Nền tảng, dữ liệu chủ và quản trị",
  "summary": "Access and profile screens, the organisation tree, users and roles, shared catalogues, working calendar, digital signature set up, integration mapping and sync monitoring, migration with dry run, retention, rule versions and comparison, master data catalogues with crosswalk and merge, data quality governance, dashboard builder, notification operations and the unified inbox, tenant branding with the new logo, platform health and backups.",
